{"unit_id":"937862061__dsh-project-workbench#card-zh","repo":"937862061/dsh-project-workbench","commit":"24eddc65fab5517b7641e3fac79f8f629bc92ff0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Project Workbench 是 DSH Web 侧栏中的项目工作台，按项目和需求组整理相关会话，并帮助团队延续每项需求的背景。它通过侧栏入口打开独立工作区，可创建需求组、添加或新建会话、调整组状态，并重命名、分叉、归档或移出会话。每组可维护摘要和备注；实际推进需求后摘要可自动更新，并在组内会话首次对话时注入。适合需要跨多个 DSH 对话推进项目的人。状态保存在本机 DSH profile 中，不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:447-459","client.js:512-517","index.js:629-683"]}
{"unit_id":"937862061__dsh-project-workbench#card-en","repo":"937862061/dsh-project-workbench","commit":"24eddc65fab5517b7641e3fac79f8f629bc92ff0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Project Workbench is a DSH Web sidebar for grouping chats by project and requirement. Create groups, add or start chats, and manage their status. Group summaries update after progress and enter the first turn of a grouped chat. State stays local; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:447-459","client.js:512-517","index.js:629-683"]}
